## Interface: 30300
## Title: Uncapped Loot Feed
## Notes: A scrolling feed of loot as it drops -- bags and Vault -- with filters and a watchlist that calls out items you are farming for, and tells you where they drop. Pop-out window or Dashboard tab.
## Author(s): Slothic, MentalMonk
## Version: 0.4
## OptionalDeps: UncappedUI, UncappedDashboard, UncappedOptions, UncappedAlerts
## SavedVariables: UncappedLootFeedDB

# Generated data first -- the lookup layer resolves both tables lazily, but
# loading them in this order means the very first frame can already answer.
UncappedLootFeedItemData.lua
UncappedLootFeedSourceData.lua
UncappedLootFeedData.lua

# Engine, then the shared widgets, then the two views over them. Rows and
# Filters must precede both views: each one grabs LF.Rows at load and bails out
# if it is missing.
UncappedLootFeed.lua
UncappedLootFeed_Rows.lua
UncappedLootFeed_Filters.lua
UncappedLootFeed_UI.lua
UncappedLootFeed_Popout.lua
